+    /**
+     * Exactly five user-defined conditions must all be true before a book is excluded from
+     * "全书架无目录书籍缓存":
+     * 1) completed visible catalog; 2) real page information; 3) same file name;
+     * 4) same file size; 5) same file location/path.
+     * No catalog-rule-version, reader-settings-hash, lastModified or reflective reader-load
+     * check participates in this prefilter.
